        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86660, Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes, the Rustic Modern Round Cabinet Knob is a fantastic addition to your kitchen remodel. This little cabinet knob is full of personality, a stunning piece against dark or light colored kitchen cabinets. The Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Round Knob is available in 2 sizes so you can choose the one that will look best in proportion to your cabinets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Sandcast Bronze Round Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86660-specifications.pdf?v=1704262412\"><b>Emtek Rustic Modern Round Cabinet Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86660-specifications.gif?v=1704354687\" width=\"600\" height=\"222\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86660 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86660:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86661:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
